ype":"paragraph","text":"私も1週間後に備えて\n髪型とかお洋服とか\nいろいろ考えておきますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月1日早く来～い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！ちなみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都へ行くのは中学の\n修学旅行以来です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都の街並みって\n凄く風情があり素敵ですよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都大好きなんです、私"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会では、\nオススメの観光名所や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都の美味しい食べ物のお話\nたくさんしましょー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"--------------------------------------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近のこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間は母の誕生日だったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃじゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マーブルガトーショコラ\nを作りました( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりのお菓子作り\nだったんだけど、\n成功して良かったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんも凄く喜んでくれたので\n作ったかいがありました*\\(^o^)/*\nお母さんおめでとう*\\(^o^)/*\nいつもありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて、最近は他にも、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校の友達と岩盤浴へ行ったり、\n(久しぶりで気持ち良かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりん純奈とカラオケへ行ったり\n(純奈と歌の選曲でジェネレーション\nギャップを感じました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんとかりんのお姉さんで\n焼肉行ったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(お姉さん優しい！伊藤家だいすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏らしい事はしてないけど、\n割と充実してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはこの夏どんなこと\nしたのかな～？？\n良かったら夏の思い出\n聞かせて下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"--------------------------------------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは最後に"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お返事TIME"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は私の好きな物シリーズ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0023.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな食べ物は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本的に甘いものが\n全般的に好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中でも\n1番はアイスクリーム"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日食べても飽きません（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抹茶、きな粉、黒ごま、紫芋\nなど和なアイスクリームか\nチョコアイスが大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他には、お食事系だと、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"納豆\nお寿司(えんがわ、中トロ)\n焼肉\nしゃぶしゃぶ\n豚汁\nなす味噌炒め\nオムライス\nハンバーグ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"など、\n挙げていたらキリがないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまり好き嫌いがないので、\nなんでも食べます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからの季節は\nさんまや柿など旬の美味しいもの\nがたくさんあるので、\n食欲の秋が楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0023.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなアーティストは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB48さん\nNMB48さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ELLEGARDENさん\n宇多田ヒカルさん\n椎名林檎さん\nMr.Childrenさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などをよく聞きます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと80年～90年代の\n歌謡曲も好きでよく聞きます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔TVでよくやってた\n懐かしソング特集とか大好きで\n毎回見てました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、まだまだ音楽は\n詳しくないので、\n皆さんのオススメも教えて\nくれたら嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0023.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな数字は？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1と2と4です！\n(多い...!笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな数字というか\n自分に所縁のある数字を\n好きになっちゃいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1と2は自分の誕生日だから\n小さい頃から好きでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4は、平成4年生まれなので\nもともと所縁のある数字ですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂に入って\n更に好きになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理由はなんと、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初お披露目が5月4日！\n初ステージが8月4日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんです！\n凄くないですか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にとって、大切な節目には\n4が付くので最近好きな数字に\n仲間入りしました♪( ´θ｀)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも大切にして行きたい\n数字です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という事で今回の質問返しは\nここまでです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で情報が少ない私たちと\nどんな事を話したらいいのか\nわからないという方が多かったので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでも話のネタになるように\n好きなものシリーズで攻めて\nみました( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでも私の事を知って貰えたら\n嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またたくさん質問待ってますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、今日は橋本さんとの\n2SHOTでお別れです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0029.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(綺麗すぎる、、、orz)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また2週間後にブログで\n会いましょうo(｀ω´ )o"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れずに待ってて下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/25/3916919/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新内眞衣"}],"source":"archive"}}